"content": "**George Salis:** Your debut novel, *Son of the Great American Novel*, is being reprinted by Tough Poets Press about half a century after its initial publication in 1971. 
The very fact it was rediscovered and being republished makes me absolutely thrilled, gobsmacked, and beside myself with delight, that someone was so moved by my words, took such 
