##### 2.5.1. Good Reading Copy (2013) – blog review

- **Title**: “The Rector of Justin by Louis Auchincloss”
- **Author**: Anonymous blogger (Good Reading Copy)
- **Publication**: Good Reading Copy (literary blog)
